        <div data-dc-tpl="449" style="background: rgb(28, 27, 24); border: 1px solid rgb(42, 40, 32); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;"><div data-dc-tpl="450" style="font-family: &quot;Barlow Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(56, 176, 73);"><span class="sc-interp">People</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="451" style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(246, 239, 228);"><span class="sc-interp">Event coordinator</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="452" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.82);"><span class="sc-interp">Menu, timeline, vendor load-in, the toast schedule.</span></div></div>
      
